  "description": "Distilled from branch Ryan_build-0.8.6-alpha2607071335 and retargeted to v0.9.0: its open PRs - those merged on the branch and those cherry-picked onto it in whole or in substance - in the branch's history order, except #8228 moved ahead of #7813 and #8598 (added by hand) last. #8676, #9840 and #8585 added 2026-10-07, distilled from Frankenstein_build-0.9.0-alpha2610051742 (picked in full, #8585 with one commit adapted); #9851 added by hand 2026-10-07; the stacked structural series #9868-#10064, #9867 (since merged upstream) added 2026-10-11, distilled from Frankenstein_build-0.9.0-alpha2610072353 (code picked in full; tests and docs not); #9555 pinned to its newer head, whose two latest commits were picked there. PRs since merged upstream (latest #9478) and 23 closed ones are left out (latest #8258, closed 2026-10-10), as is #8971 (overlaps #8200 throughout one function; left out by choice). On 2026-10-11, after upstream's edit_pset/add_representation settings and get_placement refactors, #7833, #8669 and #9517 were rebased and #8298, #8345, #8251, #8598, #8336 and #7003 had v0.9.0 merged in; #7669 was rebased onto v0.9.0 with its author's agreement. Later that day v0.9.0 was also merged into #9868-#9905, #7648/#9523, #8548, #7798/#7965/#8083 and #8304 so their calls to util.placement functions upstream removed use get_placement. On 2026-11-08 a distill of Frankenstein_build-0.9.0-alpha2610112324 added 45 PRs (the structural series to #10064, the group UI stack #9980-#9989, #10174/#10175 and others); #8344, #8676 and #9867 merged upstream and #9228 was closed as superseded, so they are out; 22 PRs were updated for v0.9.0 6a5283ac79 (#7798 chain renumbered after #9963, #7781 follows #9984's container tools, others moved clear of each other). Pins are the heads last validated at v0.9.0 (224 PRs, 215 pins), 2026-11-08.",
